WEBVTT

00:02.730 --> 00:02.770
Everyone's dream presentation

00:05.060 --> 00:09.230
And then grow up to be a cute bride.

00:09.690 --> 00:13.530
That's me! Sumeragi Matoi,
Rabbit Class of Starsea Kindergarten.

00:15.990 --> 00:19.580
Goodbye, my pure and innocent dream!

00:19.580 --> 00:22.000
Wait, this is no time to cry!

00:28.290 --> 00:30.170
I need to hurry and get home!

00:30.170 --> 00:34.720
After everything that's happened,
the police are probably still at the shrine.

00:34.720 --> 00:36.510
I need to go as far around it as I can.

00:41.100 --> 00:44.600
Thank God Shingo-san's not back yet.

00:45.230 --> 00:48.860
I hope I didn't hurt him.

00:49.400 --> 00:52.820
No, I'll worry later.
I need to make it inside!

00:54.700 --> 00:56.410
Um, where'd I put the key...

00:56.410 --> 01:00.030
As if I still have it! What do I do?

01:00.030 --> 01:01.120
Huh?

01:01.120 --> 01:03.580
Shingo-san, you're too careless!

01:03.580 --> 01:05.670
But I guess I'll let it go this time.

01:06.540 --> 01:08.000
Thank Go—

01:08.000 --> 01:08.750
Toi.

01:12.050 --> 01:14.130
Y-Yuma-chan!

01:14.130 --> 01:15.340
How did you—

01:16.340 --> 01:18.300
My parents are your landlords.

01:18.300 --> 01:20.720
A-Are they okay?

01:20.720 --> 01:24.020
They both have concussions, but they're doing just fine.

01:24.020 --> 01:26.060
That's a relief.

01:26.060 --> 01:28.520
Now I want an answer from you.

01:28.520 --> 01:31.900
Why did <i>you</i> get the demon-banishing powers?

01:32.690 --> 01:34.690
I-I don't know.

01:34.690 --> 01:37.030
And why are you naked?

01:37.030 --> 01:38.490
I'd like to know that too!

01:39.030 --> 01:41.120
So you ran all the way home naked?

01:41.120 --> 01:42.780
Completely naked?

01:42.780 --> 01:44.910
Enjoy the breeze, did ya?

01:44.910 --> 01:46.460
The way I see it, then...

01:46.750 --> 01:51.710
Matoi the exhibitionist girl had the time of her life out there, didn't she?

01:53.960 --> 01:55.720
No!

02:09.480 --> 02:10.980
Huh?

02:10.980 --> 02:11.020
{OP}

03:40.990 --> 03:44.490
Kamaya City General Hospital

03:41.570 --> 03:43.110
<i>Shin-kun, are you hurt!?</i>

03:43.110 --> 03:44.570
Ain't no big deal.

03:44.570 --> 03:47.950
More importantly, how's the Shimizu interrogation going?

03:47.950 --> 03:51.750
<i>He confessed to locking up Endou Manami in his studio, but...</i>

03:52.750 --> 03:55.000
Are you kidding?
He forgot everything after that!?

03:56.040 --> 03:58.380
Don't fall for that! He's lying!

03:58.750 --> 04:01.130
<i>It honestly doesn't seem like he is.</i>

04:01.550 --> 04:04.590
<i>Even the medical specialist
confirmed a case of amnesia.</i>

04:04.590 --> 04:07.010
Then I'll come down there and question him myself!

04:07.010 --> 04:09.850
Look, Shingo, you're injured.
Quit complaining and go home!

04:09.850 --> 04:12.020
Your daughter's worried about you.

04:12.020 --> 04:13.770
Wait, Chief!

04:15.310 --> 04:16.560
Hung up on me, dammit.

04:16.570 --> 04:19.240
good
tea

04:17.480 --> 04:19.230
That wrinkly, two-faced raccoon.

04:24.950 --> 04:26.530
<i>Look after Matoi for me</i>

04:28.490 --> 04:31.200
<i>until I get back.</i>

04:39.800 --> 04:42.260
<i>You looked like her, but you weren't.</i>

04:43.260 --> 04:46.840
<i>Hers aren't that small.</i>

04:48.300 --> 04:49.510
There it is!

04:49.510 --> 04:52.140
It's the thingy that gave you powers!

04:52.140 --> 04:55.310
But why is it coming out of your head?

04:57.900 --> 05:00.320
Yuma-chan, I think

05:01.150 --> 05:02.110
I'm going to bed.

05:02.820 --> 05:07.280
Oh, escaping from reality.
That's just like you!

05:09.330 --> 05:11.740
I Clad Myself in a God!

05:27.550 --> 05:29.000
Thank goodness!

05:29.260 --> 05:31.260
I'm still myself.

05:31.260 --> 05:33.890
I knew it was all a dream.

05:33.890 --> 05:35.310
Of course it was.

05:35.310 --> 05:37.600
There's no way I'd suddenly look older

05:37.600 --> 05:40.150
or have strange things pop out of my head.

05:59.460 --> 06:01.250
What is it? Did something happen?

06:01.250 --> 06:03.590
Shingo-san! Th-This is, uh...

06:04.210 --> 06:05.210
Matoi?

06:05.210 --> 06:07.840
Girl, what are you doing?

06:08.630 --> 06:10.300
Did you see a cockroach or something?

06:11.010 --> 06:13.430
U-Um...

06:13.430 --> 06:15.890
<i>Maybe he can't see it?</i>

06:15.890 --> 06:17.640
Y-Yeah, a cockroach.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.400
It came out of nowhere and
scared me to death!

06:19.730 --> 06:22.110
Leave it to me! I'll beat it to a pulp!

06:22.110 --> 06:23.610
I-It's okay now!

06:23.610 --> 06:26.990
And you shouldn't just
barge into a girl's room!

06:27.900 --> 06:28.950
But I'm your father!

06:28.950 --> 06:31.410
That doesn't change a thing!

06:33.450 --> 06:35.620
I thought my heart was gonna stop!

06:36.950 --> 06:40.040
Shingo-san barged in here guns blazing.

06:40.040 --> 06:42.040
I guess everything's okay for now.

06:42.040 --> 06:42.960
But...

06:43.290 --> 06:45.340
Look the other way, would you!?

06:46.840 --> 06:49.220
Listen to me!

06:49.550 --> 06:51.760
I guess luck's on your side, Toi-san,

06:51.760 --> 06:53.810
since nobody else can see it.

06:53.810 --> 06:55.200
How can this be called luck?

06:55.930 --> 06:58.730
But... I wonder why you
can still see it, then.

06:59.100 --> 07:00.980
Makes sense to me!

07:00.980 --> 07:04.900
It's because of my family heritage, performing exorcisms and all that.

07:04.900 --> 07:06.860
So I must have that talent too!

07:07.360 --> 07:09.240
Exorcisms, huh?

07:09.740 --> 07:13.070
How long do you think this thing plans on tagging along?

07:13.070 --> 07:14.740
Beats me.

07:14.740 --> 07:16.370
Figured.

07:16.370 --> 07:18.700
<i>A girl who vanished from the crime scene?</i>

07:19.080 --> 07:21.500
There's also a possibility she had achieved Divine Union.

07:21.920 --> 07:24.210
<i>And you say she's not Anti-Creed?</i>

07:24.210 --> 07:26.750
Her pattern was completely different.

07:26.750 --> 07:28.130
<i>Understood.</i>

07:28.130 --> 07:30.220
<i>I'll send Roy out your way.</i>

07:30.220 --> 07:33.390
<i>Meet up with him and find out more about that girl.</i>

07:33.390 --> 07:34.350
Understood.

07:47.940 --> 07:49.400
Luciela-san?

07:50.900 --> 07:54.490
Sir. I heard something awful happened.

07:54.490 --> 07:58.040
Yes, it was quite terrible.

07:58.040 --> 08:01.120
If you don't mind, there's
something I would like to ask.

08:12.680 --> 08:13.720
Excuse me, sir.

08:14.340 --> 08:15.970
Would you care for a beverage?

08:15.970 --> 08:17.890
No. Thank you.

08:20.980 --> 08:22.520
Sir?

08:25.310 --> 08:26.770
Don't move.

08:26.770 --> 08:29.070
You should know this is no ordinary pen.

08:29.570 --> 08:31.660
Small as it may be, it can take down an elephant.

08:33.030 --> 08:34.320
This won't do, sir.

08:34.320 --> 08:37.240
Dangerous objects like this have no place on a plane.

08:38.490 --> 08:40.000
Sir.

08:47.460 --> 08:47.500
New Email

08:47.460 --> 08:47.500
Attachment Included

09:02.560 --> 09:05.640
Yuma-chan, just let me get
changed and go home.

09:05.640 --> 09:05.690
Gym Storage

09:06.020 --> 09:08.440
No, just listen up!

09:09.060 --> 09:11.230
So I was thinking.

09:11.930 --> 09:13.250
Toi-san,

09:13.650 --> 09:18.490
There must be an important reason for this thing to give <i>you</i> the demon-banishing powers.

09:18.870 --> 09:19.740
Like what?

09:19.740 --> 09:22.620
What do you think?
For banishing demons, of course!

09:22.620 --> 09:24.120
I don't wanna.

09:25.960 --> 09:28.330
You're doin' it 'cause I said so!

09:28.330 --> 09:29.380
I object!

09:29.380 --> 09:30.800
Overruled!

09:30.800 --> 09:31.710
After all,

09:31.710 --> 09:37.050
that power should have rightfully gone to <i>me</i>,
the descendant of a Shinto priest.

09:37.050 --> 09:41.430
I don't know if it was an accident or what,
but now <i>you</i> have this power,

09:41.430 --> 09:46.480
so you have an obligation to act as a bringer of justice in my stead.

09:46.480 --> 09:47.710
No way...

09:47.710 --> 09:49.520
You've got demon-banishing duties now!

09:49.770 --> 09:51.440
Or, for short...

09:51.440 --> 09:52.980
Demon Duties!

09:51.440 --> 09:52.990
Demon Duties

09:51.530 --> 09:52.990
Demon
Duties

09:57.240 --> 10:00.450
So, let's get straight to practice! Start by transforming!

10:00.450 --> 10:04.410
Easy for you to say.
I don't know how to transform.

10:05.830 --> 10:07.120
If you would, please.

10:07.120 --> 10:07.920
Huh?

10:09.460 --> 10:11.670
No way! H-Hey, wait!

10:13.460 --> 10:15.420
We're at school!

10:16.970 --> 10:20.470
W-Wait! Wait, wait, wait!

10:26.350 --> 10:27.350
What do I do?

10:27.350 --> 10:28.310
What do I do, what do I—

10:35.570 --> 10:37.700
U-Um...

10:38.560 --> 10:41.320
She looks like a magical girl!

10:42.780 --> 10:45.620
Not a magical girl, an exorcist girl!

10:45.620 --> 10:46.830
An exorcist girl?

10:46.830 --> 10:48.080
Is this some kind of cosplay?

10:48.080 --> 10:49.460
No!

10:49.460 --> 10:50.790
I mean...

10:50.790 --> 10:54.000
Not at all. She's the genuine article.

10:54.000 --> 10:55.000
Yuma-chan!

10:55.000 --> 10:56.590
I don't get it, but she looks cool!

10:56.590 --> 10:58.010
Ain't that getup embarrassing?

10:58.010 --> 10:59.760
What's she doing at school?

10:59.760 --> 11:01.720
D-Don't take my picture.

11:01.720 --> 11:03.220
Don't post it online.

11:03.220 --> 11:06.310
Don't tweet this!

11:07.190 --> 11:09.530
Let's all practice
safe driving for Safety
Awareness Month!

11:07.190 --> 11:09.530
Safety starts in your
heart and your planning!

11:07.190 --> 11:09.530
Kamaya City Police Station

11:09.530 --> 11:11.320
Violent Crimes Division

11:11.510 --> 11:14.650
Shimuzi, you weasel.
Medical care? The hospital?

11:14.650 --> 11:15.900
Amnesia, my ass!

11:15.900 --> 11:19.450
Shin-kun! Check out this video
that just got uploaded!

11:19.450 --> 11:21.700
They're saying a magical girl appeared!

11:21.700 --> 11:23.820
Are you insane, Poochi?

11:23.820 --> 11:26.990
The view counter is going mad!

11:27.700 --> 11:29.160
A magical girl?

11:29.910 --> 11:31.080
[Descent from Heaven] Could it be the real thing!? A magical girl appears!

11:30.160 --> 11:31.080
See?

11:33.580 --> 11:34.800
That girl...

11:35.090 --> 11:37.550
[Descent from Heaven<b>] </b>Could it be the real thing!? A magical girl appears!

11:37.750 --> 11:42.010
What does she intend to do by showing her face like this?

11:42.010 --> 11:43.510
Sorry for having you meet me.

11:43.800 --> 11:44.680
It's fine.

11:45.800 --> 11:47.350
First and foremost,

11:48.890 --> 11:50.730
let us share what we know.

11:55.400 --> 11:59.570
Earlier today, a Body of
Divine Union was spotted

11:59.570 --> 12:02.070
at the school listed in
that girl's file I sent you.

12:03.110 --> 12:04.660
Understood.

12:05.620 --> 12:07.120
Roy! Where are you going?

12:07.120 --> 12:08.790
I'll handle the rest on my own.

12:08.790 --> 12:10.410
What are you—

12:10.410 --> 12:11.040
Roy!

12:27.220 --> 12:29.190
Exorcist Girl @taimashojo

12:27.220 --> 12:29.190
Will defeat even the strongest demons! Devoting every day to exorcism!
Let me know if you've got a demon in your closet.

12:27.220 --> 12:29.190
Following

12:27.220 --> 12:29.190
Tweets

12:27.220 --> 12:29.190
Media

12:27.220 --> 12:29.190
Info

12:27.220 --> 12:29.190
Mikaduki Renk @renka_mikad

12:27.220 --> 12:29.190
My doll's hair keeps growing. It's scaring me! Please help me save her!

12:27.220 --> 12:29.190
Muryoku_11go @muryoku_11go

12:27.520 --> 12:29.180
Wh-What is this?

12:29.180 --> 12:31.930
What do you mean?
It's the Exorcist Girl's twitter.

12:31.930 --> 12:33.890
Don't just make this stuff without telling me!

12:33.890 --> 12:36.810
You've been getting quite the response, Toi-san.

12:37.890 --> 12:40.350
Requests are coming in left and right.

12:37.900 --> 12:40.370
kamenoko @kamenokosan

12:37.900 --> 12:40.370
Morita from District Three  @3morita

12:37.900 --> 12:40.370
Every day my cat goes into the meeting room and starts meowing loudly.
She sounds completely different than normal.

12:37.900 --> 12:40.370
I wasn't seeing things, I swear! There was some kind of cloud right in front
of me, shaped like a worm!

12:37.900 --> 12:40.370
My shoulders got heavy out of nowhere, like something was sitting on me.

12:37.900 --> 12:40.370
Tweets

12:37.900 --> 12:40.370
Media

12:37.900 --> 12:40.370
Info

12:40.350 --> 12:42.730
There are this many demons out there?

12:42.730 --> 12:47.110
"Morita from District Three" says his shoulders got heavy like something was sitting on him.

12:47.110 --> 12:49.740
It's gotta be some kind of demon possession!

12:49.740 --> 12:51.700
They're probably just stiff, not heavy...

12:51.700 --> 12:53.410
Okay, off we go!

12:53.410 --> 12:54.950
Let's just forget about it!

12:54.950 --> 12:56.290
But we have to hurry.

12:56.290 --> 12:59.170
We don't know when your
transformation will wear off.

12:59.170 --> 13:01.330
That's not what—

13:01.880 --> 13:03.340
What's that noise?

13:04.590 --> 13:06.800
He has a gun! Run!

13:08.720 --> 13:11.140
Toi-san, people are in trouble. Now's your chance!

13:11.140 --> 13:14.140
This is <i>my</i> responsibility now?

13:20.020 --> 13:22.600
He's clearly acting with some goal in mind.

13:24.070 --> 13:25.270
Prepare yourself,

13:27.240 --> 13:28.530
Clarus.

13:35.030 --> 13:36.080
What's the situation?

13:36.080 --> 13:37.040
Sir.

13:37.040 --> 13:40.460
We were investigating reports of a suspicious man last seen near Kamaya Middle School.

13:40.960 --> 13:44.090
When an officer from the local station questioned him,

13:44.090 --> 13:45.880
he pulled out a shotgun and started firing.

13:46.420 --> 13:49.880
He then fled to a nearby bank and barricaded himself inside.

13:49.880 --> 13:52.590
It would seem he is using the bank employees as hostages.

13:52.840 --> 13:55.390
It turned into a bank robbery out of nowhere?

13:55.390 --> 13:57.350
Where's the commanding officer?

13:57.350 --> 13:58.470
What are you doing?

13:58.470 --> 13:59.350
This way, sir.

13:59.350 --> 14:01.440
Negotiating. What else?

14:01.440 --> 14:02.980
Ah, wait!

14:04.810 --> 14:06.140
Shingo-san...

14:06.140 --> 14:08.610
Your dad sure is passionate about his job.

14:08.610 --> 14:09.900
Yeah...

14:09.900 --> 14:12.820
Yuma-chan, we should leave this to the police.

14:12.820 --> 14:15.620
Situations like these need professionals.

14:20.160 --> 14:22.170
Wh-What is that?

14:24.500 --> 14:25.880
I-It can't be.

14:25.880 --> 14:27.420
That's...

14:27.420 --> 14:28.300
Toi-san!

14:29.160 --> 14:30.630
Your dad!

14:33.050 --> 14:34.930
He's going into the bank!

14:38.640 --> 14:41.350
<i>Shingo-san, don't!</i>

14:50.990 --> 14:52.950
Hold on, I'm only here to talk.

14:52.950 --> 14:54.700
I'll hear any demands you...

14:55.200 --> 14:58.410
You... Kasai, you're already on the wanted list.

14:58.410 --> 15:00.910
But a white-collar criminal robbing banks?

15:01.700 --> 15:03.000
That doesn't add up.

15:03.330 --> 15:04.870
What are you really after?

15:06.080 --> 15:08.420
Come on, talk to me.

15:11.510 --> 15:12.550
That face...

15:12.550 --> 15:14.840
He has the same look Shimizu did.

15:14.840 --> 15:15.720
This is bad.

15:15.720 --> 15:17.800
S-Stop right there!

15:20.470 --> 15:21.640
You!

15:26.600 --> 15:27.150
Hey!

15:27.560 --> 15:28.480
Hang on!

15:29.110 --> 15:31.730
That hurt!

15:31.730 --> 15:32.490
Huh?

15:32.990 --> 15:34.990
You're not hurt? But how?

15:37.950 --> 15:39.490
Kasai, you—

15:41.240 --> 15:42.620
I knew it.

15:49.790 --> 15:50.540
What?

15:52.680 --> 15:53.460
What is that?

15:53.460 --> 15:55.300
Hey, get back!

15:58.930 --> 16:00.680
Th-Th-Th-This is...

16:01.430 --> 16:03.270
The Gate of Caelum has opened.

16:05.560 --> 16:07.230
I'll go after <i>him</i>.

16:07.230 --> 16:08.810
Shall I hold back?

16:08.810 --> 16:09.560
No need.

16:17.740 --> 16:20.200
System halt. Status: unconfined.

16:21.030 --> 16:21.870
Come.

16:25.960 --> 16:27.040
Divine Union.

16:30.540 --> 16:31.750
Toi-san, answer me!

16:31.750 --> 16:33.500
Where are you?

16:36.840 --> 16:38.680
Toi-san! Are you okay?

16:38.680 --> 16:39.840
Yuma-chan!

16:39.840 --> 16:41.850
What on Earth is all this?

16:41.850 --> 16:43.600
I don't know.

16:43.600 --> 16:45.270
But hurry up and run!

16:45.270 --> 16:47.440
Run? Why would I—

16:58.280 --> 17:00.820
It's a demon! And a pretty
mean looking one, too!

17:00.820 --> 17:02.660
Hmm, so in situations like this...

17:02.950 --> 17:04.790
I see, I see.

17:12.920 --> 17:14.500
Yuma-chan!

17:22.640 --> 17:24.680
P-Please stop!

17:26.060 --> 17:28.310
<i>I have no idea what's happening.</i>

17:28.310 --> 17:29.690
<i>But if this continues,</i>

17:29.940 --> 17:32.600
<i>Yuma-chan, Shingo-san, and everyone else will...</i>

17:33.190 --> 17:35.440
<i>But how can I stop it!?</i>

17:35.440 --> 17:37.650
<i>It doesn't matter. I have to do something!</i>

17:41.110 --> 17:43.280
D-Don't come closer!

17:43.280 --> 17:44.780
Stay back!

17:54.880 --> 17:55.630
Toi-san!

18:02.430 --> 18:04.300
Get away from her!

18:04.300 --> 18:06.260
Lecher! Molester! Pervert!

18:13.350 --> 18:15.020
Wh-What's happening?

18:35.960 --> 18:37.500
Who...

18:37.500 --> 18:39.800
Wh-Who are you?

18:42.340 --> 18:43.630
I'm bored.

18:50.850 --> 18:53.440
This dimension is as far as you will go.

18:58.320 --> 19:00.400
You're the weakest of the weak.

19:02.570 --> 19:03.530
Farewell.

19:25.510 --> 19:27.850
I-Incredible!

19:28.350 --> 19:31.060
She exorcised the demon?

19:43.190 --> 19:44.740
Enjoying the show?

19:45.650 --> 19:48.320
I know you're watching.

19:58.170 --> 19:59.700
It should be clear to you by now.

20:00.210 --> 20:03.840
You can't escape from me.

20:08.930 --> 20:10.640
If I chase down that Night...

20:11.350 --> 20:13.270
U-Um...

20:13.930 --> 20:16.480
I don't know who you are,
but thank you for saving me—

20:16.480 --> 20:18.100
Who are you?

20:18.100 --> 20:20.490
Huh? Um...

20:20.490 --> 20:23.610
Why do you have a Regalia?

20:23.610 --> 20:25.400
How can you accomplish Divine Union?

20:25.780 --> 20:28.610
Regalia? Divine Union?

20:28.610 --> 20:30.160
What are those?

20:30.160 --> 20:33.000
I have no idea what's going on.

20:33.450 --> 20:36.250
I see. So you know nothing.

20:37.920 --> 20:38.750
If that's the case...

20:45.510 --> 20:46.760
Say your prayers.

20:57.690 --> 20:59.850
Feeling your heart

20:59.850 --> 21:08.610
hito wa umarenagara hikari to kage wo

20:59.850 --> 21:08.610
It's natural for us all to be followed

21:08.610 --> 21:14.620
matoi tsuzukeru

21:08.610 --> 21:14.620
by light and shadow

21:14.620 --> 21:18.120
The lonely one

21:20.290 --> 21:22.330
Feeling your heart

21:22.330 --> 21:31.050
You can obtain all you've ever wanted

21:22.380 --> 21:31.090
hoshii mono subete te ni ireru koto

21:31.050 --> 21:37.310
sore ga shiawase nano

21:31.050 --> 21:37.310
But is that truly happiness?

21:37.310 --> 21:42.270
darekaga egao nara

21:37.310 --> 21:42.270
If someone is smiling,

21:42.270 --> 21:48.780
dokokade kitto naiteru hito ga ite

21:42.270 --> 21:48.780
somewhere, someone else is probably crying

21:48.780 --> 21:54.990
surechigau hodo itooshiku omou

21:48.780 --> 21:54.990
As our paths continue to cross,

21:54.990 --> 21:59.790
kimochi ga aru

21:54.990 --> 21:59.790
our love grows stronger

21:59.790 --> 22:04.790
hitotoki no aida ni

21:59.790 --> 22:04.790
In that short span of time

22:04.790 --> 22:11.300
bokura wa minna mujun wo dakishimete

22:04.790 --> 22:11.300
we embrace all contradictions

22:11.300 --> 22:19.430
as we watch the lights that lead us to tomorrow

22:11.340 --> 22:19.480
ashita e no hikari wo mitsume nagara

22:19.430 --> 22:24.610
aruiteku no kana

22:19.430 --> 22:24.610
I wonder if we'll keep walking this path

22:31.110 --> 22:32.820
T-Toi-san!

22:33.860 --> 22:35.280
I see.

22:35.740 --> 22:38.660
That's the god who lavished you in power.

22:38.660 --> 22:41.080
Wh-What are you doing!?

22:42.120 --> 22:46.210
It's a good thing your god wasn't a Night.

22:47.040 --> 22:50.090
If it had been, I wouldn't show mercy.

22:50.090 --> 22:51.550
What are you talking about?

22:51.920 --> 22:54.300
Gods? Nights...?

22:54.300 --> 22:57.730
I don't understand a thing you said!

22:59.430 --> 23:00.520
Hey!

23:01.890 --> 23:03.890
Where are you going?

23:03.890 --> 23:06.310
You two should leave this place quickly.

23:07.060 --> 23:11.320
This space will soon return to normal now that the Night has been destroyed.

23:12.400 --> 23:14.450
You'll return to your normal reality.

23:18.200 --> 23:20.910
It will "return to normal"?

23:20.910 --> 23:22.500
Does that mean...

23:23.080 --> 23:24.420
back to the bank!?

23:24.420 --> 23:26.250
Yuma-chan, let's get out of—

23:27.040 --> 23:28.880
One, two, one, two...

23:28.880 --> 23:30.880
Slow down!

23:30.880 --> 23:31.840
Wait!

23:31.840 --> 23:34.340
Wait, wait up!

23:34.340 --> 23:36.180
No!

23:36.840 --> 23:38.970
Wh-What the—

23:41.470 --> 23:44.300
No!

23:49.060 --> 23:50.440
Don't take my picture!

23:50.440 --> 23:51.820
Don't post it online!

23:52.070 --> 23:56.030
Don't tweet this!

23:56.830 --> 23:59.120
My transformed self became famous,

23:58.200 --> 23:58.240
[Descent from Heaven] Could it be the real thing!? A magical girl appears!

23:59.120 --> 24:00.630
a demon appeared,

24:00.630 --> 24:03.460
and a mysterious girl clad
in armor showed up...

24:03.460 --> 24:05.510
Please, God, do something!

24:06.040 --> 24:11.050
Episode 3

24:06.040 --> 24:11.050
God is Playing Dumb

24:06.130 --> 24:08.550
Next time, "God is Playing Dumb."

24:08.550 --> 24:11.050
So you're ignoring us? I see how it is.
